0.12 0.14 0.18 rg
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 282 Td (Contemporary educational leadership increasingly relies on empirical school data and) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 268 Td (digital supervisory platforms to elevate teaching quality in urban public school) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 254 Td (systems. Within the Department of Education \(DepEd\) National Capital Region,) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 240 Td (secondary school heads are mandated to lead instructional supervision under the) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 226 Td (Philippine Professional Standards for School Heads \(PPSSH\).) Tj ET
0.12 0.14 0.18 rg
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 208 Td (However, bridging administrative data collection and actionable pedagogical coaching) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 194 Td (remains a persistent challenge. This manuscript examines how public secondary school) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 180 Td (heads synthesize classroom observation records, assessment analytics, and digital) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 166 Td (coaching tools to support faculty instructional competence.) Tj ET
