0.12 0.14 0.18 rg
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 340 Td (The study is anchored on Mandinach and Gummer \(2016\) Data Literacy for Educators) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 326 Td (Framework and the DepEd Philippine Professional Standards for School Heads \(DepEd) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 312 Td (Order No. 24, s. 2020\). Using the Input-Process-Output \(IPO\) model, school head) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 298 Td (profiles, supervisory domains, and digital readiness indicators serve as inputs) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 284 Td (analyzed through descriptive and inferential statistics to formulate an) Tj ET
BT /F3 10 Tf 42 270 Td (institutional Digital Supervision Enhancement Program.) Tj ET
